== Trivia ==
* The game files name 4.5 Volt's icon as "''assaultbattery''", which may imply "Assault Battery" was its original name.
** [[wikipedia:Assault and battery|Assault and battery]] is the combination of two violent crimes in common law: assault (the threat of violence) and battery (physical violence).

